]) 

Explanation: 
• 
The $match stage filters the reviews collection to include only reviews where 
the rating is less than 3. These are considered poor or negative reviews. This is the 
starting point of the pipeline. 
• 
Because $lookup returns an array (productInfo), this $unwind stage flattens it into a 
single object. This allows us to directly access fields inside the product document 
(like productInfo.name). 
• 
This $project stage reshapes the output. It hides the default _id field and shows 
the productName. 

